chemes\n<MATH_0003>.\nBy Algebra, Lemma <REF_0001>\nthis is a homeomorphism of <MATH_0004> onto a closed\nsubset of <MATH_0005>. Moreover, if <MATH_0006>\nis a prime corresponding to a point <MATH_0007>, <MATH_0008>,\n<MATH_0009>, then on stalks we get the map\n<MATH_0010>\nThus we see that <MATH_0011> is a closed immersion of locally ringed spaces,\nsee Definition <REF_0002>.\nClearly, this is (isomorphic) to the closed subspace associated\nto the quasi-coherent sheaf of ideals <MATH_0012>, as in\nExample <REF_0003>.\n<STRUCT_0002>", "source_text_hash": "sha256:4b263baf138bf34d923d2714cccc5b48f5f3924fb1a4fe6301480cc3712579fd", "unit_id": "inventory:schemes:01IG:example/0001"}}}, {"context_id": "sha256:8af23356c6f7bbddad454d2893b49121b8e4fd4631c5a369f095dc23ca1f56a1", "hash": "sha256:8af23356c6f7bbddad454d2893b49121b8e4fd4631c5a369f095dc23ca1f56a1", "value": {"kind": "locked-English-reference", "location": {"byte_end": 12484, "byte_start": 12198, "file": "schemes.tex", "fragment_hash": "sha256:3b3412f683ffd899ca8f9a342308e23970449bcaf21ac75d5e0d8cdf0f747202", "line_end": 362, "line_start": 356}, "owner_tag": "01HL", "parent_tag": "01HJ", "requested_label": "schemes-lemma-closed-local-target", "requested_tag": "01HL", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_unit": {"chapter": "schemes", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "01HJ", "placeholders": {"LOCKED_0001": "\\label{lemma-closed-local-target}", "MATH_0001": "$f : Z \\to X$", "MATH_0002": "$f$", "MATH_0003": "$X = \\bigcup U_i$", "MATH_0004": "$f : f^{-1}U_i \\to U_i$", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{lemma}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\end{lemma}"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:f5d08f51154fd61ad0005933f8a14320c047de7dcde3dd45959b85ebb1147261", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:9821037db0bdef2db7bad76d93b35f5f317c64762c0f1f68b7c721d00ed4